--- !u!114 &229408630
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 229408628}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LeanLocalization::Lean.Localization.LeanPhrase
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Spawns a fixed-color tile into any empty space when a tile is cleared
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Fait appara\xEEtre une tuile de couleur fixe dans n'importe quel espace
      vide lorsqu'une tuile est effac\xE9e"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Erzeugt eine Kachel mit fester Farbe auf einem beliebigen leeren Feld,
      wenn eine Kachel abger\xE4umt wird"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Genera una tessera di colore fisso in qualsiasi spazio vuoto quando una
      tessera viene eliminata
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30BF\u30A4\u30EB\u304C\u30AF\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3068\u3001\u4EFB\u610F\u306E\u7A7A\u304D\u30B9\u30DA\u30FC\u30B9\u306B\u56FA\u5B9A\u8272\u306E\u30BF\u30A4\u30EB\u3092\u751F\u6210\u3057\u307E\u3059"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uD0C0\uC77C\uC744 \uC9C0\uC6B8 \uB54C \uBE48 \uACF5\uAC04\uC5D0 \uACE0\uC815
      \uC0C9\uC0C1 \uD0C0\uC77C\uC744 \uC0DD\uC131\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Gera uma pe\xE7a de cor fixa em qualquer espa\xE7o vazio quando uma pe\xE7a
      \xE9 limpa"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0421\u043E\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043F\u043B\u0438\u0442\u043A\u0443
      \u0444\u0438\u043A\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
      \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0430 \u0432 \u043B\u044E\u0431\u043E\u043C \u043F\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043E\u043C
      \u043C\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0435, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043F\u043B\u0438\u0442\u043A\u0430
      \u043E\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Genera un mosaico de color fijo en cualquier espacio vac\xEDo cuando se
      limpia un mosaico"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
