--- !u!114 &1159780799
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1159780797}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LeanLocalization::Lean.Localization.LeanPhrase
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Spawns hunter ants that defeat the boss spider to clear its webbed tiles
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "G\xE9n\xE8re des fourmis chasseuses qui battent l'araign\xE9e patronne
      pour nettoyer ses tuiles palm\xE9es."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Bringt J\xE4gerameisen hervor, die die Boss-Spinne besiegen, um ihre vernetzten
      Kacheln freizumachen"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Genera formiche cacciatrici che sconfiggono il ragno boss per ripulire
      le sue tessere ragnatele
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30DC\u30B9 \u30B9\u30D1\u30A4\u30C0\u30FC\u3092\u5012\u3057\u3066\u6C34\u304B\u304D\u306E\u3042\u308B\u30BF\u30A4\u30EB\u3092\u53D6\u308A\u9664\u304F\u30CF\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC
      \u30A2\u30EA\u3092\u30B9\u30DD\u30FC\u30F3\u3057\u307E\u3059"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uBB3C\uAC08\uD034\uAC00 \uC788\uB294 \uD0C0\uC77C\uC744 \uCCAD\uC18C\uD558\uAE30
      \uC704\uD574 \uBCF4\uC2A4 \uAC70\uBBF8\uB97C \uBB3C\uB9AC\uCE58\uB294 \uC0AC\uB0E5\uAFBC
      \uAC1C\uBBF8\uB97C \uC0DD\uC131\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Gera formigas ca\xE7adoras que derrotam a aranha-chefe para limpar seus
      ladrilhos com membranas"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0421\u043E\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043C\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0432\u044C\u0435\u0432-\u043E\u0445\u043E\u0442\u043D\u0438\u043A\u043E\u0432,
      \u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0430\u044E\u0442
      \u043F\u0430\u0443\u043A\u0430-\u0431\u043E\u0441\u0441\u0430 \u0438 \u043E\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0430\u044E\u0442
      \u0435\u0433\u043E \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043F\u043E\u043D\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044B\u0435
      \u043F\u043B\u0438\u0442\u043A\u0438."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Genera hormigas cazadoras que derrotan a la ara\xF1a jefa para limpiar
      sus mosaicos palmeados."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
