--- !u!114 &1427958286
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1427958284}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LeanLocalization::Lean.Localization.LeanPhrase
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: A snake blocks paths to tiles, collect special ants to defeat it and clear
      the path
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Un serpent bloque les chemins vers les tuiles, collectez des fourmis sp\xE9ciales
      pour le vaincre et d\xE9gager le chemin"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Eine Schlange blockiert den Weg zu den Spielfeldern. Sammle spezielle Ameisen,
      um sie zu besiegen und den Weg freizumachen
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Un serpente blocca i percorsi verso le tessere, raccogli formiche speciali
      per sconfiggerlo e liberare il percorso
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30D8\u30D3\u304C\u30BF\u30A4\u30EB\u3078\u306E\u9053\u3092\u585E\u3044\u3067\u3044\u308B\u3002\u7279\u5225\u306A\u30A2\u30EA\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u3066\u30D8\u30D3\u3092\u5012\u3057\u3001\u9053\u3092\u7A7A\u3051\u308B"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uBC40\uC774 \uD0C0\uC77C\uB85C \uAC00\uB294 \uAE38\uC744 \uB9C9\uACE0,
      \uD2B9\uBCC4\uD55C \uAC1C\uBBF8\uB97C \uBAA8\uC544 \uD0C0\uC77C\uC744 \uBB3C\uB9AC\uCE58\uACE0
      \uAE38\uC744 \uBE44\uC6B0\uC138\uC694."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Uma cobra bloqueia o caminho at\xE9 os ladrilhos, colete formigas especiais
      para derrot\xE1-la e limpar o caminho"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0417\u043C\u0435\u044F \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442
      \u043F\u0443\u0442\u044C \u043A \u043F\u043B\u0438\u0442\u043A\u0430\u043C,
      \u0441\u043E\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u043F\u0435\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043B\u044C\u043D\u044B\u0445
      \u043C\u0443\u0440\u0430\u0432\u044C\u0435\u0432, \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B
      \u043F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044C \u0435\u0435 \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044C
      \u043F\u0443\u0442\u044C"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Una serpiente bloquea los caminos hacia las baldosas, recolecta hormigas
      especiales para derrotarla y despejar el camino.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
